CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchRaptorPatrol
"Raptor &Patrol"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchRaptorPatrol
"Raptors watch the area for 45 seconds. Each enemy aircraft that enters is attacked by a Raptor (up to 3 passes)."
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchA10Watch
"A-10 &Watch"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchA10Watch
"A-10s watch the area for 45 seconds. Enemy vehicles that enter are hit by an A-10's missiles and cannon (up to 2 passes)."
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchMiGPatrol
"MiG &Patrol"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchMiGPatrol
"MiGs watch the area for 45 seconds. Enemy aircraft that enter are attacked by a pair of MiGs, each after its own target (up to 3 passes)."
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchMiGHunter
"MiG &Hunters"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchMiGHunter
"MiGs watch the area for 45 seconds. Enemy vehicles that enter are hit by a pair of MiGs with armour-piercing missiles that leave Black Napalm burning (up to 3 passes)."
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchStingerNest
"Stinger &Nest"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchStingerNest
"A camouflaged Stinger Site appears at the spot for 60 seconds. Its three soldiers fire at enemy aircraft and come back while the site stands. Firing reveals the soldiers, not the site."
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchTrapField
"&Trap Field"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchTrapField
"Ten hidden demo traps are scattered over the area for 60 seconds. Each blows up when an enemy vehicle comes close. Detectors can find them."
END
